{
 "_report": "Starfall, rebuilt on the V3 world kit. Arrive at Rim Camp (kept: the sandbagged pad, gate home, medic tent swapped to the kit Recovery Bay on id 137, Ostrander/Tamsin scenes). East through Starfall Lane Homes (new shop door) to Crater Crossroads (hub): Quiet Court north (Observation Post, Helix field office, and the hidden Starfall Secret Grove with a chest off its west side), Farmstead Edge south (Seedpod Greenhouse) with the Rift Crater Arena (lobby + battle floor) off its west side, and Seedpod Fields A east (kept, Zib's pod scene). Seedpod Junction (hub) follows: east to Teo's Old Camp and the kept Crater Rim -> Crater Descent B1-B3 -> Rift Engine Platform (Director Thorne) chain; north through Pod Fields (Seedpod Shells collect spot) and Nebula Overlook up Craterstep Slope to the optional Starstone Hollow (entrance + 3 floors, chest); south down Starstream Bend to Rift Fork: the Starfall Spaceport (second way home) east, Seedpod Hollows (dead end, chest) west, Rift Edge (dead end, chest) south.",
